* FD-09  Common-mode rejection
* AC 1 V common-mode source at VCOM drives both input resistors of the gain -1
* network.  (Vop + Von)/2 gives the input-CM to output-CM transfer, (Vop - Von)
* the CM-to-DM transfer (zero for a symmetric design).
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-16 vntol=1e-10
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
IBIAS vdd ibias {{IBIAS}}
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
VI vi vcm DC 0 AC 1
R1 vi inp {{R_NET}}
R2 inp outn {{R_NET}}
R3 vi inn {{R_NET}}
R4 inn outp {{R_NET}}
XDUT vss ibias vdd vcmpin inp inn outp outn {{DUT}}
RVCM_DUT vcm vcmpin 1k
RLP outp vcm {{RL}}
CLP outp 0 {{CL}}
RLN outn vcm {{RL}}
CLN outn 0 {{CL}}
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 50 10m 1G
write {{RAW}} v(outp) v(outn)
.endc
.end
